<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gallaher Group.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gallaher Group.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Gallaher Group Plc  as outperform.</p>
<p>-- Gallaher was spun off from American Brands Inc, which changed its name to Fortune Brands Inc.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
